      "content": "but help just makes it worse. every time someone tries to \"help\" me, they just spend more time, more energy, and more money on me. it's just more weight for them to carry. it feels like the only way to actually stop hurting them is to just... stop being part of the equation. it's the only selfless thing I could ever actually do.",
